' ─────────── RbPanZoom — canonical S22 pan/zoom class (R22.2); R31.6 EXTENDS it (concept) ───────────
' RATIFIED 2026-07-26 (architect, req disk-win): RbPanZoom ALREADY EXISTS from Sprint 22 (e5e3c885, R22.2
' panZoom.mouseParity) — NOT freshly minted. My earlier "mint fresh RbPanZoom" target was wrong (unmeasured);
' req correctly REUSED the canonical class per R27.2 and added ONLY the applyPanZoom concept-method. The R31.6
' concept is a coherent EXTENSION/generalization of this same class (pan/zoom is one concern), not a new one.
class RbPanZoom {
  +attachMouse()            'S22/R22.2 IMPLEMENTED — mouse pan/zoom parity (Impl 0564d93b)
  +applyPanZoom() <<concept>> 'R31.6 concept: generalizes attachMouse into a SHARED pan/zoom viewer-base every embedded viewer extends (pinch/drag -> CSS transform); designAhead, NO Impl/Test until Tron authorizes
}

' ─────────── relations ───────────
RbPanZoom <|.. RbProfileView : <<concept>> embedded viewers extend pan/zoom base (R31.6)
RbPanZoom <|.. RbTerminalDetail : <<concept>> (R31.6 shared viewer capability)
ServerManagerGuard <.. FeatureManager : gates writes (root-of-trust)
Feature "1" o-- "*" FeatureManager : manages allowedUsers[]
FeatureManager ..> RbProfileView : grantedUserProfile feeds
ProfileView ..> RbProfileView : profileViewData feeds (shared)
ProfilePage ..> RbProfileView : /profile renders via (same viewer)
RbFeatureDetail --|> RbDetailDrawer : detail-view in shared drawer
RbProfileDetail --|> RbDetailDrawer : detail-view in shared drawer
RbTerminalDetail --|> RbDetailDrawer : detail-view in shared drawer
RbTraceTree ..> OtmuxBridge : /tree roots from readSessionTree
RbTraceTree ..> FeatureManager : /feature-manager roots from featureRoots
PtyBridge <.. RbTerminalDetail : ws PTY bridge
RbStrip "1" o-- "*" RbCompartment : composes segments
RbStrip <.. RbSnapNav : nav targets compartments
RbEditorLayout ..> RbStrip : editor = strip instance
RbWoda ..> RbStrip : WODA = strip instance
RbDetailDrawer ..> RbCompartment : data-position=inline = Details compartment
Build ..> ServerConfig : generateVersion stamps; getVersion reads boot-frozen
Build ..> Feature : Config = typed scenario unit (single-source)

@enduml
